  edit: 'M11 4H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v12a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2v-5 M18.5 2.5a2.12 2.12 0 0 1 3 3L12 15l-4 1 1-4 9.5-9.5Z',
